# server 镜像以仓库根为构建上下文，只需要这几处；其余（Rust 构建产物、node_modules、主页）不进上下文
*
!server
!rules
!tasks
!temporal-rules
!integrations
!integrations/dygk
integrations/dygk/.upstream
integrations/dygk/.downloads
integrations/dygk/node_modules
integrations/dygk/runtime-state
integrations/dygk/**/.git
integrations/dygk/**/.env*
integrations/dygk/**/node_modules
integrations/dygk/**/*.sqlite*
server/pi-runtime/node_modules
